      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_40",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$companion_id",
            text: _("So."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("So."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$companion_id",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$companion_id",
            text: _("Guess you’re the boss now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("It would seem as such. Would that Delfador had stayed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 4000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$companion_id",
            text: _(""),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Elves? No. Be not fooled by a pretty face — I have seen even the noblest elven sage corrupted to such darkness as to rival the foulest human or orc."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Although, I suppose there is at least one young elf of my acquaintance to whom I might ascribe such virtues. My thoughts find her often, in these dark times."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 4000,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Kestrel",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 2,
            x: 39,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Kestrel",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Kestrel",
            x: 34,
            y: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Eldred",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "se",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kestrel",
            text: _("Sir, Delfador and the Royal Cavalry are out of sight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Eldred",
            x: 30,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("<span size='small'>_Father.</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("All healed up? Excellent. Come out of the rain and join me in my tent. We’ll soon put this rebellion to rest."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Eldred",
            x: 27,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Garard",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "se",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("I admit, I was worried about you, son. <i>“Soft”</i> I thought — if I should fall, could you truly lead our people to victory? I wanted to toughen you up."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("But now? Sniffing out treachery in our own family? Taking it upon yourself to bring Arand to justice! You may have failed to defeat him, but failure does not diminish the trying. You did well today, Eldred."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Eldred",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Eldred",
            type: "Crown Prince",
            side: 2,
            x: 27,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Eldred",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Eldred",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Eldred",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "set_variable",
                name: "this_item.side",
                value: 9,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "silence.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:harm_unit",
            amount: 63,
            kill: "no",
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Garard%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Garard",
            primary_attack_range: "melee",
          },
          {
