          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("WAKE! ALARM! DEORAN HAS SLAIN THE KING!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("What!?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Deoran",
            x: 26,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "$companion_id",
            x: 25,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("<i>(_Garard truly is dead, and by the sword at that! Eldred was the last to enter...)</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("See Deoran there, standing now at the mouth of my father’s tent? He strikes in cold blood, at the height of my father’s triumph! He takes revenge for his long years of exile! Only a heart shaped by hate and twisted by elves could commit such a foul deed!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("No! Eldred is—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "eldred4",
            text: _("Calamity! The ambassador always seemed so polite! How could he do this? How could we let him do this?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("No! I—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "eldred3",
            text: _("We all know that Deoran was not loved by the king. All this while he must have been biding his time, plotting his attack! And look, that outlaw of Delfador’s stands beside him, witness and accomplice to the crime!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Deoran",
          },
          {
