              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("(aghast) Horrors below, Garard’s own son; what has happened to my beautiful kingdom? How—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I don’t— what do I do? They all believe Eldred!? I’m not ready for a fight!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "STORE_UNIT_VAR_store",
            kill: "no",
            id: "$companion_id",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "companion_name",
            value: "$STORE_UNIT_VAR_store.name",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$companion_id",
            text: _(""),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I— yes, you’re right! With Garard dead, Delfador commands the greatest honest force left in Wesnoth, and he has no idea what has just transpired! Delfador must be warned."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("If we are lucky, we may yet be able to save Arand from Delfador’s ill-informed assault. But even barring that, Delfador’s leadership can surely rally enough soldiers to oppose Eldred by force of arms! $companion_name, go, now! Slip away along the eastern road!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "$companion_id",
            x: 31,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
