          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_68",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_69",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "are_all_leaders_dead",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_71",
        on: "branch_if_71",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "gold",
            greater_than: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("One leader is defeated. I had hoped to gain a new ally, but depriving Eldred and buying time is good enough. And now that this keep is ours, I can recruit more soldiers to aid in the fight."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_72",
        on: "branch_if_72",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "gold",
            less_than_or_equal_to: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("One leader is defeated. I had hoped to gain a new ally, but depriving Eldred and buying time is good enough."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_74",
        on: "keep_captured_explanation",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Deoran’s putting up a real fight! But even if he defeats me, he’ll never get back into Wesnoth — we still have soldiers encamped on the southern shore."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_73",
        on: "keep_captured_explanation",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_70",
        on: "keep_captured_explanation",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_gold",
            side: 1,
            variable: "gold",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_71",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_72",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I should remember — soldiers I evacuate east will be available to fight Eldred later, but if I evacuate too many I will be too weak to fight effectively here!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_75",
        on: "ill_will_dialogue",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "eldred2,eldred3,eldred4,eldred5,eldred6,eldred7,eldred8",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("So much ill will... The captains of old would have died for their king."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Perhaps it is not a coincidence that so many of the old guard fell in battle against the orcs."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_76",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22eldred2%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("You are defeated, mage! Lend me your ear and hear the truth about Garard’s death! ’twas not I who struck the blow, but Prince Eldred!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I’m not stupid, Deoran; I’ve heard the whispers about how Asheviere is raising her son. But isn’t it all for the best? Garard wasn’t going to give up warmongering until we were all dead; at least this way maybe I can get back to Alduin in one piece!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%22%24unit.side%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "give_bonus_gold",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "ill_will_dialogue",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            experience: "$( $this_unit.experience + 8*$unit.level )",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24second_unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "$second_unit.id",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_77",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22eldred3%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("You—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Don’t even start. Garard dragged me away from my life of luxury to be an officer in his lousy war. I always wanted him dead, and I’m glad someone finally built up the courage to do it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Kill me if you must, but I’ll never condemn the prince’s actions. From what I hear, Garard was a pretty lousy father and husband too. Now am I free to go, or not?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("That’s what I thought. Now get out of my way — my men and I are going back home to Weldyn."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%22%24unit.side%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "give_bonus_gold",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "ill_will_dialogue",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            experience: "$( $this_unit.experience + 8*$unit.level )",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24second_unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "$second_unit.id",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_78",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22eldred4%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Colonel! You’re a man of experience, and a man of wisdom. Do you not care for your king? Do you truly believe that it was by my hand he fell?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I cared for Garard, but I care even more for the soldiers and common folk of Wesnoth, folk who have just been plunged into civil war."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Whether the deed was done by your hand or Eldred’s, it is my duty as a commander to end the fighting as swiftly as possible. And that means crushing your revolt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("You poor fool... can you not guess what horrors will come with a kin-slayer on the throne? Sometimes we must fight not just for the people of today, but for the people who will come after."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I should finish you off, but your heart is in the right place. I cannot bear to slay a righteous man. Begone."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%22%24unit.side%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "give_bonus_gold",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            experience: "$( $this_unit.experience + 8*$unit.level )",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24second_unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "$second_unit.id",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_80",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%22%24unit.side%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "give_bonus_gold",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "ill_will_dialogue",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_79",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22eldred5%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Your sword has failed you, knight of Wesnoth! Now use your ears instead, and hear the truth about our King Garard’s death!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Spare me the theatrics, Deoran. I know Eldred’s the one who took down the old tyrant."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("But gold is gold, and the prince has offered my wife and me a whole lot of it to stick with the “official” story. Prince Eldred knows how to reward his allies. Give up now, accept the blame, and he might even let you spend the rest of your days back in exile instead of prison."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Garard was no hero, but you, soldier, are a villain. May your heirs prove wiser than you were."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_81",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22eldred6%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("(<i>spits</i>) Traitor. Kill me if you must, but I will never betray my country."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("My comrade-in-arms, you already have. Look around! Eldred commands you to fight and die on his behalf, while he himself has fled the battlefield. Are these the actions of an orphaned son, filled with a righteous desire for vengeance? Or is this a scheming usurper, pitting his kingdom against itself while he watches from a safe distance?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("You know me, Sir Grey; we have fought side by side for many years now. Do you truly believe that I would conspire with Delfador to assassinate the king?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%22%24unit.side%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "give_bonus_gold",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            experience: "$( $this_unit.experience + 8*$unit.level )",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24second_unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "$second_unit.id",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_82",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22eldred7%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Wait, please don’t kill me Deoran! I know that you would never betray Garard, but what do you expect me to do about it!? If even the king can be killed, what hope do I have if I speak up?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Then stand alongside me, and we will fight together for the truth! Eldred’s lies cannot be allowed to spread."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Fighting together with you didn’t do the king much good, did it? No, my company and I are getting back to Tath while we still have the chance!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
