              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Well, well, if it isn’t Deoran the exile, one-time commander of the South Guard; a soldier to the very end. I’ve heard all about you, you know. A perfect example of who not to be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Did you really think you could win? Even if you had bested my army — yes, it’s <b><i>my</i></b> army now — I now carry with me so much magic that I’ll never have to lose another fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("At last the usurper dares to face me, now that I am too injured for battle. He knows his actions are unforgivable. He knows he cannot face me in a fair fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("I also know you’re a man of your word, so I’m going to give you a choice. You can surrender, leave Wesnoth, and swear to never again raise arms up against my rule."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Or you can fight, die, and have your corpse hoisted upon the walls of Weldyn as a warning to others. Which will it be, exile?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("More than anything does my spirit yearn to go on fighting, to risk it all on a chance at vanquishing the one responsible for all this wretched destruction!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("But my heart remembers better places, happier times. There are... people I wish to speak to, things I have left unsaid..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Prince Eldred, I lay down my arms and accept your offer of surrender."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:harm_unit",
            amount: 17,
            kill: "no",
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Deoran%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Deoran",
            primary_attack_range: "melee",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Deoran",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
